/P 158 0 R
/E (In Task 1 the selected model, a 64-unit GRU, obtains 91.15% validation accuracy and 89.58% test accuracy. In Task 2 the selected baseline, a two-layer 32-unit GRU, obtains 99.55% validation accuracy and 96.27% test accuracy; among all models including the extensions, a bidirectional two-layer GRU has the highest validation accuracy \(99.70%\) and reaches 97.55% on the test set. In both tasks the gated cells \(LSTM and GRU\) reached higher validation accuracy than the vanilla RNN; in Task 2 they also trained more reliably and generalized clearly better. )
