endobj
694 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 173 0 R
/T (Figure7 shows the mean gradient norm before clipping during training. The vanilla RNN has large and erratic gradient norms, with spikes of about 30 and 25 against a clipping threshold of 5, whereas the LSTM and GRU gradient norms stay below about 2 and decrease smoothly. This irregular behavior of the RNN is consistent with its noisy loss curve and with the need for gradient clipping. )
