/T (Theconfusion matrix of the selected extended model shows the same dominant error pattern as the baseline, but with fewer mistakes overall \(54 errors against 82 on the 2,200 test utterances\): digit 6 is still predicted as digit 0 for 13 utterances, and digit 8 is predicted as digit 3 for 6 utterances. )
