/Title (Digit 5 is recognized best \(recall 96.10%, 148 of 154 correct\) and digit 9 has the highest precision \(97.12%\). Digit 6 is the hardest class, with a recall of only 77.92%: 17 of the 154 test images of digit 6 are predicted as digit 7, and a further six are predicted as digit 8. Digit 0 has the lowest precision \(86.16%\) because several other classes are occasionally)
